      </ul> </div> <!-- SINGLE CTA --> <div class="cta-section"> <h3>See ioNova ARS in action</h3> <p>The complete ISO 20022 Postal Address &mdash; Requirements and Specifications Update 2026 consolidates the CPMI harmonisation requirements, the BIS PIE taskforce report, the PMPG Hybrid Postal Address whitepaper and the EPC address guidance into a single reference.</p> <a class="btn btn-accent" href="https://ionova.ai/demo">Book a demo <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></a> </div> </section> <section class="section"> <div class="section-label">Related Terms</div> <h2 class="section-title">See also</h2> <div class="related-grid"> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/pstladr-element"><h4>PstlAdr element</h4><p>PstlAdr is the ISO 20022 XML container for a party's postal address. CPMI harmonisation requirements — technical annex catalogues 17 child elements — 14…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/structured-address-elements"><h4>Structured address elements</h4><p>The dedicated ISO 20022 address fields: StrtNm (70 chars), BldgNb (16), PstCd (16), TwnNm (35), CtrySubDvsn (I…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/adrline"><h4>AdrLine</h4><p>AdrLine is the free-format element of the ISO 20022 PstlAdr block: 70 characters per line, up to 7 in unstruct…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/iso-20022"><h4>ISO 20022</h4><p>ISO 20022 is the open standard for financial messaging — pacs, pain, camt XML. From 15 November 2026 payment a…</p></a> </div> </section> </article>
